  "name": "Grilled Baked Potatoes",
  "subtitle": "Tender foil-wrapped potatoes with crisp skins",
  "description": "Russet potatoes are lightly oiled, seasoned, wrapped in foil, and grilled until tender for a simple American side dish.",
